1
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,430
How do I have this kind of power?

2
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:02,990
Did this fool watch over me all night?

3
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,129
Wifey, you're awake.

4
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,900
How do you feel?

5
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,260
Are you uncomfortable anywhere?

6
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:08,930
Who exactly was I before?

7
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:10,930
You are my wife.

8
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,160
Who else could you be?

9
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:19,700
Wifey,

10
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,260
are you hungry?

11
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:32,289
Wifey's stomach is growling right under my nose.

12
00:01:32,729 --> 00:01:34,460
This is my failure as a husband.

13
00:01:34,630 --> 00:01:37,930
It's a disgrace and an unforgivable sin.

14
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,660
It's not that serious.

15
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:42,900
Wifey, wait here.

16
00:01:44,229 --> 00:01:46,289
I will go find you some food right now.

17
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:49,060
Even if I have to search the entire Demon Realm,

18
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:51,990
even if I have to go through fire and water, even if...

19
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,220
That's really not necessary.

20
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:02,730
Wifey, I'm heading out.

21
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,900
When you miss me,

22
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,500
just look at the most handsome cloud in the sky.

23
00:02:06,530 --> 00:02:07,530
Don't be reckless

24
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:09,300
and cause trouble again.

25
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,300
Sir, buy a pancake?

26
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:36,800
Give me two.

27
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,600
Alright, ten spirit stones for one pancake.

28
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,400
That's twenty spirit stones in total.

29
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,200
Hahaha.

30
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,530
Can I buy it on credit?

31
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:45,190
Go away. How can you eat pancakes without money?

32
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,360
I see this pancake has no destiny with you.

33
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,460
Why don't you form a destiny with me?

34
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:55,400
Hey, don't get physical.

35
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,030
Ah, I'll give you a destiny!

36
00:03:04,460 --> 00:03:05,530
Ah!

37
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:07,360
Move aside, move aside.

38
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,460
Is that it?

39
00:03:24,230 --> 00:03:25,200
Good moves.

40
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,260
Thanks for letting me win.

41
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,360
Don't let him get away.

42
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,200
Ah!

43
00:03:34,930 --> 00:03:35,460
Baili.

44
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:38,100
I, the dignified Supreme of the Demon Realm, am in such a sorry state for you.

45
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:39,360
Are you moved to tears?

46
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,400
Wifey, it's hot.

47
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,060
I keep my word.

48
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,260
What's stuck on your back?

49
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,260
It's all because of my good looks.

50
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:19,829
They were chasing you to beat you up, right?

51
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:26,560
She smiled. She smiled at me.

52
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,460
What does this mean?

53
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:28,900
It means she's been waiting for me to come back.

54
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,030
It means she has me in her heart.

55
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:31,400
It means she likes me.

56
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,300
No, it means she loves me.

57
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:33,760
She loves me to death.

58
00:04:33,930 --> 00:04:35,130
Then we will get married soon.

59
00:04:35,130 --> 00:04:36,460
I want two kids. No,

60
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,100
three kids.

61
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:38,030
The oldest will be called Cang Da.

62
00:04:38,030 --> 00:04:39,300
The second will be called Cang Er.

63
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:40,530
Hehehe.

64
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:46,030
Why are you standing there like a fool?

65
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:47,630
The pancake is getting cold.

66
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:48,960
You are right to scold me, Wifey.

67
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,560
Come, let me check it for you.

68
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,600
Cold food hurts the stomach.

69
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,600
I'll eat the cold part.

70
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,560
You eat this piece.

71
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,760
The middle of this piece is the hottest.

72
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:56,960
Take it.

73
00:04:57,030 --> 00:04:58,760
Wifey shared half a pancake with me.

74
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:01,960
The weight of this half pancake is equal to a token of love.

75
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:03,600
I will definitely treasure it.

76
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,660
If you don't eat it, I'll take it back.

77
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,860
Three mace of angelica.

78
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:11,130
Five mace of astragalus.

79
00:05:11,130 --> 00:05:12,260
And one more ingredient.

80
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:13,730
What is this black stuff?

81
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:14,960
Achoo!

82
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:21,630
Cough, cough.

83
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,760
Cangyuan, what are you doing?

84
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,430
Brewing medicine.

85
00:05:23,430 --> 00:05:25,560
I'm brewing medicine to nourish your qi and blood, my wife.

86
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,060
You were so badly injured, my wife.

87
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:27,960
You need to recover well.

88
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,100
You call this medicine?

89
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:30,100
It might look a bit ugly.

90
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:31,630
But my heart is in it.

91
00:05:31,630 --> 00:05:32,690
Every drop is love.

92
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,630
Are you trying to poison me?

93
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,230
How could you misunderstand me, my wife?

94
00:05:37,230 --> 00:05:37,960
I brewed medicine for you.

95
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,020
I even hurt my hand.

96
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:40,430
Oh.

97
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,020
Use this to bandage it.

98
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:44,560
She wants to bandage me.

99
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,300
She cares about me.

100
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:46,300
This is a token of love.

101
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,360
We even have a token of love now.

102
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,560
Will marriage be far behind?
